        "PRAS 0.9.0 empirical energy-CVAR uses samples strictly greater than the empirical quantile. In this all-identical deterministic sample fixture, no sample is strictly above VaR and the returned CVAR is zero. This is an implementation-specific tail convention, not a generic expected-shortfall value."
